<section class="q-section" id="zeit"><div class="q-section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Realistische Zeitanalyse</p><h2>Was tatsächlich verfügbar ist</h2></div></div><div class="q-lock"><strong>Montag ist bewusst geschlossen.</strong><p>Nach Sainte-Rose-du-Nord → Tadoussac → Walbeobachtung → Québec City planen wir nur Hotel, Erholung und Abendessen. Keine Führung, keine Fähre, kein Nachtspaziergang als Pflichtpunkt.</p></div><div class="q-grid q-grid-3"><article class="q-card"><h3>Dienstagvormittag</h3><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>Zeit</small><b>ca. 08:45–12:30</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Rolle</small><b>Hauptblock 1</b></div></div><p>Ideal für Altstadttour <b>oder</b> Montmorency.</p></article><article class="q-card"><h3>Dienstagnachmittag</h3><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>Zeit</small><b>ca. 13:30–17:30</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Rolle</small><b>Hauptblock 2</b></div></div><p>Citadelle + Oberstadt oder ausführliches Vieux-Québec nach Montmorency.</p></article><article class="q-card"><h3>Dienstagabend</h3><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>Zeit</small><b>ca. 18:30–22:00</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Rolle</small><b>Dinner + 1 Idee</b></div></div><p>Langes besonderes Dinner <b>oder</b> kompakter essen und danach Nachtspaziergang, Fähre oder Ghost Tour.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="q-section" id="bereiche"><div class="q-section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Geografie</p><h2>Québec in verständlichen Bereichen</h2></div></div><p class="q-intro">Das Hotel liegt im Vieux-Port. Unterstadt und Oberstadt sind nah, aber durch Steigungen getrennt. Montmorency ist ein eigener Auto-Ausflug.</p><div class="q-grid q-grid-3"><article class="q-card"><h3>Vieux-Port</h3><p>Historische Speicherhäuser, Hafen, Rue Saint-Pierre und Musée de la civilisation. Ruhiger als der touristische Kern.</p><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>ab Hotel</small><b>0–8 Min.</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Zeit</small><b>30–90 Min.</b></div></div><div class="q-links"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Vieux-Port+Quebec+City">Google Maps ↗</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;q=Vieux-Port+Quebec+City">Fotos ansehen ↗</a></div></article><article class="q-card"><h3>Petit-Champlain & Place Royale</h3><p>Postkarten-Québec mit Kopfsteinpflaster, alten Steinhäusern, kleinen Läden und früher Siedlungsgeschichte.</p><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>ab Hotel</small><b>10–15 Min.</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Zeit</small><b>60–90 Min.</b></div></div><div class="q-links"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Petit-Champlain+Quebec+City">Google Maps ↗</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;q=Petit-Champlain+Place+Royale+Quebec+City">Fotos ansehen ↗</a></div></article><article class="q-card"><h3>Château & Oberstadt</h3><p>Château Frontenac, Terrasse Dufferin, Stadtmauer und das klassische Panorama über den Sankt-Lorenz-Strom.</p><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>ab Hotel</small><b>15–20 Min. bergauf</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Zeit</small><b>1½–3 Std.</b></div></div><div class="q-links"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Terrasse+Dufferin+Quebec+City">Google Maps ↗</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;q=Chateau+Frontenac+Dufferin+Terrace+Quebec+City">Fotos ansehen ↗</a></div></article><article class="q-card"><h3>Citadelle & Plains</h3><p>Festungsanlage, Militärgeschichte und das Schlachtfeld von 1759. Die Citadelle ist aktive Militärbasis und nur geführt zugänglich.</p><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>ab Hotel</small><b>25–30 Min.</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Zeit</small><b>1½–3 Std.</b></div></div><div class="q-links"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=La+Citadelle+de+Quebec">Google Maps ↗</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;q=Citadelle+de+Quebec+Plains+of+Abraham">Fotos ansehen ↗</a></div></article><article class="q-card"><h3>Montmorency</h3><p>83 Meter hoher Wasserfall mit Hängebrücke, Aussichtspunkten, Treppe und saisonaler Seilbahn.</p><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>realistische Anfahrt</small><b>25–30 Min.</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>gesamt</small><b>2½–3 Std.</b></div></div><div class="q-links"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Parc+de+la+Chute-Montmorency">Google Maps ↗</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;q=Montmorency+Falls+Quebec">Fotos ansehen ↗</a></div></article><article class="q-card"><h3>Île d’Orléans</h3><p>Ländliche Insel mit Cidre, Landwirtschaft, Käse, Beeren, Wein und St.-Lorenz-Landschaften – attraktiv, aber zeitintensiv.</p><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>Zeit</small><b>3½–5 Std.</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>für uns</small><b>nur bei hoher Priorität</b></div></div><div class="q-links"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ile+d%27Orleans+Quebec">Google Maps ↗</a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;q=Ile+d%27Orleans+Quebec">Fotos ansehen ↗</a></div></article></div></section>
<section class="q-section" id="varianten"><div class="q-section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Dienstag · 28.09.</p><h2>Drei echte Tagesvarianten</h2></div></div><div class="q-variants"><article class="q-card q-variant"><header><span class="q-badge">A · Ausgangsfavorit</span><h3>Das klassische Québec</h3><p>Altstadt, Geschichte, Aussicht und starker Abend.</p></header><div class="q-body"><div class="q-timeline"><time>09:30–11:30</time><div><b>Geführtes Vieux-Québec</b><br>klassisch oder historische Figurenführung.</div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>11:30–13:45</time><div><b>Petit-Champlain + Mittag</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>14:00–16:00</time><div><b>Citadelle</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>16:00–17:00</time><div><b>Dufferin / Mauern</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>17:00–18:15</time><div><b>Hotelpause</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>18:30+</time><div><b>Dinner + optional Nacht</b></div></div><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>Laufen</small><b>ca. 8–10 km</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Wetter</small><b>mittel robust</b></div></div><div class="q-procon"><div class="q-pro"><b>Dafür</b><br>maximale Québec-Dichte.</div><div class="q-con"><b>Dagegen</b><br>kein Naturausflug.</div></div></div></article><article class="q-card q-variant b"><header><span class="q-badge">B · Stadt + Natur</span><h3>Altstadt + Montmorency</h3><p>Mehr Bandbreite, weniger Tiefe in der Stadt.</p></header><div class="q-body"><div class="q-timeline"><time>08:45</time><div><b>Abfahrt Hotel</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>09:15–11:15</time><div><b>Montmorency</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>11:45–13:00</time><div><b>Zurück + Mittag</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>13:30–15:30</time><div><b>Geführtes Vieux-Québec</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>15:30–17:00</time><div><b>Petit-Champlain / Dufferin</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>17:15–18:15</time><div><b>Hotelpause</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>18:30+</time><div><b>Dinner + optional Nacht</b></div></div><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>Laufen</small><b>ca. 6–8 km + Fall</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Wetter</small><b>empfindlicher</b></div></div><div class="q-procon"><div class="q-pro"><b>Dafür</b><br>starker Kontrast Stadt/Natur.</div><div class="q-con"><b>Dagegen</b><br>Citadelle fällt praktisch heraus.</div></div></div></article><article class="q-card q-variant c"><header><span class="q-badge">C · Genuss</span><h3>Québec genießen</h3><p>Kulinarik, Atmosphäre, Aussicht und mehr Luft.</p></header><div class="q-body"><div class="q-timeline"><time>09:15–10:30</time><div><b>Place Royale + Petit-Champlain</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>11:00–14:00</time><div><b>Food Tour</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>14:00–14:45</time><div><b>Kaffee / Pause</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>15:00–16:30</time><div><b>Château + Dufferin + Mauern</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>16:45–18:30</time><div><b>Hotelpause</b></div></div><div class="q-timeline"><time>19:00+</time><div><b>Besonderes Dinner</b></div></div><div class="q-meta"><div class="q-metric"><small>Laufen</small><b>ca. 5–7 km</b></div><div class="q-metric"><small>Wetter</small><b>relativ robust</b></div></div><div class="q-procon"><div class="q-pro"><b>Dafür</b><br>viel Atmosphäre, wenig Hetze.</div><div class="q-con"><b>Dagegen</b><br>Montmorency/Citadelle entfallen.</div></div></div></article></div></section>
